        "kind": "input_format_entry_point",
        "detail": "Library added JSON format support via plist_from_json() and plist_from_memory() with JSON dispatch. Old harness only calls plist_from_xml() and plist_from_bin(), so JSON parsing code (695 lines jplist.c + 280 lines jsmn.c) is completely unreachable."
      }
    ]
  },
  "evidence": [
    "CISPA case study: large feature added (json support, 3900 -> 4700 lines code), without harness update, fixed later on",
    "Local verification: h(M^1) x lib(M) shows 0 coverage on plist_from_json (jplist.c:628) and jsmn_parse (jplist.c:652)",
    "Coverage reports: https://storage.googleapis.com/oss-fuzz-coverage/libplist/reports/20211222/linux/src/libplist/report.html -> https://storage.googleapis.com/oss-fuzz-coverage/libplist/reports/20211223/linux/src/libplist/report.html"
  ],
  "rationale": {
    "zh": "库新增JSON格式支持（plist_from_json及相关代码），增加了695行jplist.c和280行jsmn.c。但旧harness只调用plist_from_xml和plist_from_bin，新的JSON解析入口完全无法触达，新增的近1000行代码覆盖率为0。属于本次引入的隐式input_format退化。",
    "en": "Library added JSON format support (plist_from_json and related code), adding 695 lines of jplist.c and 280 lines of jsmn.c. However, the old harness only calls plist_from_xml and plist_from_bin. The new JSON parsing entry points are completely unreachable, with 0% coverage on nearly 1000 lines of new code. Silent input_format degradation introduced by this change."
  },
